1
00:00:07,560 --> 00:00:08,920
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

2
00:01:36,920 --> 00:01:38,920
ADAPTED FROM <i>THE EARLY SPRING</i> ON JJWXC.NET
AUTHOR: GU NIANG BIE KU

3
00:01:59,840 --> 00:02:01,800
<i>You got one word wrong. Retype everything.</i>

4
00:02:03,960 --> 00:02:05,240
<i>Your father scolded you back then.</i>

5
00:02:05,320 --> 00:02:07,640
<i>You got angry and broke the typewriter.</i>

6
00:02:10,720 --> 00:02:13,120
<i>Although your father hit you with a ruler,</i>

7
00:02:13,640 --> 00:02:16,640
<i>he still fixed the typewriter</i>
<i>until three in the morning.</i>

8
00:02:17,480 --> 00:02:19,800
<i>He even had me lie to you</i>
<i>and say the nanny fixed it.</i>

9
00:03:23,480 --> 00:03:26,640
THE FIRST PERSON
TO FALL IN LOVE WILL LOSE EVERYTHING

10
00:03:28,800 --> 00:03:31,840
Mr. Luan, you've lost it.

11
00:03:33,360 --> 00:03:37,040
<i>I just want to keep</i>
<i>a professional distance between us.</i>

12
00:03:37,600 --> 00:03:39,120
She can control it.

13
00:03:39,200 --> 00:03:40,440
Why would I lose control?

14
00:03:42,960 --> 00:03:45,520
All right. You didn't lose control.

15
00:03:50,880 --> 00:03:53,200
Oh. I bought a new car.

16
00:03:53,280 --> 00:03:54,840
Help me claim it as expenses.

17
00:03:59,200 --> 00:04:01,240
LIME SUPPLIER DATABASE - EVENT COMPANIES

18
00:04:01,320 --> 00:04:03,200
LIME SUPPLIER DATABASE - PHOTOGRAPHY TEAM

19
00:04:03,280 --> 00:04:04,480
LIME SUPPLIER DATABASE - MEDIA COMPANY

20
00:04:04,560 --> 00:04:06,880
Have you verified the data in this column?

21
00:04:12,800 --> 00:04:14,520
Have a piece of cake first.

22
00:04:14,600 --> 00:04:15,760
Let me help you amend it.

23
00:04:20,680 --> 00:04:21,880
Tao.

24
00:04:22,400 --> 00:04:23,240
Listen to me.

25
00:04:23,320 --> 00:04:28,080
Lowering your boss's expectations
appropriately is also a life hack.

26
00:04:28,160 --> 00:04:29,360
Don't back yourself into a corner.

27
00:04:29,440 --> 00:04:30,440
Lower it more?

28
00:04:31,560 --> 00:04:34,040
I'm already worthless,
and I still have to lower it?

29
00:04:34,560 --> 00:04:36,520
He'll just fire me.

30
00:04:41,840 --> 00:04:46,000
I heard a very important figure
sent you back tonight.

31
00:04:49,360 --> 00:04:50,240
Have you had a new breakthrough?

32
00:04:51,400 --> 00:04:53,240
What are you talking about?

33
00:04:53,920 --> 00:04:57,560
I'm just a rookie
who just stepped out of the tutorial.

34
00:04:57,640 --> 00:04:59,840
I've faced a max-level boss.

35
00:04:59,920 --> 00:05:01,800
An ultimate move from him,
and I'd have died multiple times.

36
00:05:01,880 --> 00:05:03,080
Don't talk nonsense.

37
00:05:04,200 --> 00:05:06,880
Encountering troubles at work is common.

38
00:05:06,960 --> 00:05:08,920
I'll work a bit
to help you out this weekend.

39
00:05:09,000 --> 00:05:09,840
Really?

40
00:05:10,480 --> 00:05:11,600
Thank you.

41
00:05:13,200 --> 00:05:15,400
Tao, I'm worried about you now.

42
00:05:16,320 --> 00:05:20,440
How long can you last walking a tightrope
between your work performance

43
00:05:20,520 --> 00:05:22,000
and your feelings?

44
00:05:23,760 --> 00:05:29,000
Our instructor told us
to maintain a safe distance

45
00:05:29,080 --> 00:05:31,560
if we didn't want to collide
with the car in front.

46
00:05:32,120 --> 00:05:33,080
Your instructor is right.

47
00:05:33,160 --> 00:05:34,160
But did he tell you this?

48
00:05:34,760 --> 00:05:36,200
If you encountered a steep corner,

49
00:05:36,800 --> 00:05:39,520
you panicked and stepped on the gas pedal,

50
00:05:39,600 --> 00:05:42,920
you wouldn't be able to control
whether the car would flip over or not.

51
00:05:46,400 --> 00:05:48,600
It's dangerous. It's too dangerous.

52
00:05:53,920 --> 00:05:55,520
The board has made a decision.

53
00:05:55,600 --> 00:05:57,400
Mr. Lin will be transferred
to the United States.

54
00:05:59,760 --> 00:06:02,440
He wanted me
to win Yueteng back this quickly

55
00:06:02,520 --> 00:06:05,120
because he wanted to go
to the headquarters to give a job report.

56
00:06:06,480 --> 00:06:08,720
Can you focus on yourself?

57
00:06:09,520 --> 00:06:12,400
I heard your appointment
as the interim general manager

58
00:06:12,480 --> 00:06:13,720
will become official soon.

59
00:06:14,680 --> 00:06:16,160
You just heard about it.

60
00:06:16,240 --> 00:06:17,480
Let me know when it is official.

61
00:06:18,000 --> 00:06:20,560
Don't tell me
that you're not interested in a promotion.

62
00:06:22,600 --> 00:06:25,320
You need to handle
the Yueteng project well.

63
00:06:25,400 --> 00:06:26,760
Do it steadily.

64
00:06:26,840 --> 00:06:28,400
Don't cause any unnecessary trouble.

65
00:06:29,000 --> 00:06:32,760
For example, doing some kind
of supplier grading scheme.

66
00:06:32,840 --> 00:06:34,600
Breaking the long-standing custom

67
00:06:35,200 --> 00:06:37,840
means affecting
other people's slice of the pie.

68
00:06:38,680 --> 00:06:39,520
What?

69
00:06:40,440 --> 00:06:42,160
Someone even made complaints to you?

70
00:06:43,800 --> 00:06:45,400
That means my decision is working.

71
00:06:46,240 --> 00:06:49,080
A long-standing custom
doesn't mean it's a good cycle.

72
00:06:49,160 --> 00:06:52,400
What you need to do
is find talents that the company can use.

73
00:06:52,480 --> 00:06:55,880
What I need to do is prevent
financial losses for the company.

74
00:07:02,200 --> 00:07:04,040
LIME SUPPLIER EVALUATION TABLE

75
00:07:07,200 --> 00:07:09,600
Judging from your expression,
is there some kind of good news?

76
00:07:11,160 --> 00:07:14,720
The employee you hired is quite capable
when it comes to execution.

77
00:07:15,240 --> 00:07:16,960
She made something impossible happen.

78
00:07:29,760 --> 00:07:31,680
We'll separate suppliers
into three categories.

79
00:07:31,760 --> 00:07:34,800
Event companies, photography teams,
and media channels.

80
00:07:36,280 --> 00:07:38,040
We will visit these suppliers

81
00:07:38,120 --> 00:07:42,480
and give them a grade
based on various factors.

82
00:07:44,440 --> 00:07:45,840
Take event companies, for example.

83
00:07:45,920 --> 00:07:48,440
We'll rate them in terms of past events,

84
00:07:48,520 --> 00:07:50,800
brand expertise, and cooperation levels.

85
00:07:51,600 --> 00:07:52,880
SUPPLIER RATINGS BASED ON VARIOUS FACTORS

86
00:07:53,480 --> 00:07:54,720
THANK YOU FOR YOUR TIME

87
00:07:54,800 --> 00:07:56,840
We'll continue to refine the details.

88
00:08:04,400 --> 00:08:06,920
Coming here is worth it today.

89
00:08:07,480 --> 00:08:11,520
Your proposal is efficient,
simple, and innovative.

90
00:08:11,600 --> 00:08:13,360
It has completely exceeded
our expectations.

91
00:08:13,440 --> 00:08:16,720
The most impressive thing about it
is that you've compiled

92
00:08:16,800 --> 00:08:20,000
such a systematic supplier database
for our project.

93
00:08:20,760 --> 00:08:22,560
The standard of Lime is indeed impressive.

94
00:08:24,520 --> 00:08:25,720
You're right.

95
00:08:27,120 --> 00:08:28,680
Before I came here,

96
00:08:28,760 --> 00:08:29,360
WAN JUN, YUETENG'S REPRESENTATIVE

97
00:08:29,440 --> 00:08:31,880
I heard Mr. Luan from Lime
has the "Hand of God."

98
00:08:32,720 --> 00:08:34,000
I've finally known
the meaning of the phrase

99
00:08:34,080 --> 00:08:35,400
"speed is the essence of war" today.

100
00:08:35,480 --> 00:08:36,320
I'm impressed.

101
00:08:39,080 --> 00:08:40,400
I'm not the only one in Lime.

102
00:08:41,000 --> 00:08:42,480
There are also many outstanding employees.

103
00:08:42,559 --> 00:08:44,880
The prototype of this database
you see here

104
00:08:44,960 --> 00:08:47,560
was spearheaded by Flora,

105
00:08:48,520 --> 00:08:49,720
who recently joined the team.

106
00:08:52,640 --> 00:08:54,840
Mr. Luan, not only are you capable,

107
00:08:54,920 --> 00:08:56,120
but your management skills
are also top-notch.

108
00:08:56,920 --> 00:09:00,200
Since we have a strong
supplier database to back us up,

109
00:09:00,880 --> 00:09:03,360
the annual framework
that we talked about previously

110
00:09:03,880 --> 00:09:04,880
can also proceed.

111
00:09:04,960 --> 00:09:06,160
Great.

112
00:09:06,240 --> 00:09:08,160
I'll get the legal department
to draft a contract right away.

113
00:09:08,240 --> 00:09:09,400
Right, Luke?

114
00:09:09,960 --> 00:09:11,120
You can arrange it.

115
00:09:18,280 --> 00:09:19,520
Thank you very much.

116
00:09:19,600 --> 00:09:20,680
To a great partnership.

117
00:09:20,760 --> 00:09:22,240
- Thank you.
- To a great partnership.

118
00:09:22,320 --> 00:09:23,520
Take care.

119
00:09:28,520 --> 00:09:29,960
As expected of you, Luke.

120
00:09:30,040 --> 00:09:31,000
You got the client successfully.

121
00:09:33,000 --> 00:09:35,800
Flora, you've also been outstanding today.

122
00:09:35,880 --> 00:09:39,560
You completed the initial phase
of the supplier database alone.

123
00:09:39,640 --> 00:09:41,800
It's not something you can do
with just a few clicks of the mouse.

124
00:09:42,760 --> 00:09:45,400
It requires strong logical thinking
and data analysis skills.

125
00:09:46,120 --> 00:09:47,520
Not bad.

126
00:09:47,600 --> 00:09:49,000
You are quite the talent.

127
00:09:49,080 --> 00:09:52,160
My boss taught me well,
and my colleagues helped me a lot.

128
00:09:54,320 --> 00:09:59,160
Does the HRBP only praise people
without giving any actual reward?

129
00:09:59,960 --> 00:10:01,920
No need. It's what I should do.

130
00:10:02,000 --> 00:10:03,320
Why not?

131
00:10:03,400 --> 00:10:05,000
Do you not want to become
a senior account executive?

132
00:10:07,480 --> 00:10:09,520
It's possible for you to become an SAE.

133
00:10:10,120 --> 00:10:11,160
However, the company policy states

134
00:10:11,240 --> 00:10:13,560
that you need the signature
and recommendation from your superior.

135
00:10:13,640 --> 00:10:17,280
Do you want Luke or Alex
to be your referrer?

136
00:10:21,520 --> 00:10:23,240
I'll go with the boss's decision.

137
00:10:25,640 --> 00:10:26,520
‪Tracy.

138
00:10:33,920 --> 00:10:34,840
I see.

139
00:10:38,200 --> 00:10:40,680
Luke, let's talk in the office.

140
00:10:40,760 --> 00:10:41,720
Sure.

141
00:10:49,160 --> 00:10:52,480
There's a very tricky problem now.

142
00:10:53,560 --> 00:10:54,680
What is it?

143
00:10:56,160 --> 00:10:57,240
How should we celebrate this?

144
00:10:59,920 --> 00:11:01,000
Anything is fine.

145
00:11:09,600 --> 00:11:12,040
I thought today's meeting
was interesting enough.

146
00:11:12,120 --> 00:11:15,280
I didn't expect to see
something even more interesting.

147
00:11:18,440 --> 00:11:19,320
LIME'S SENIOR EXECUTIVE
FOOLS AROUND WITH MULTIPLE WOMEN

148
00:11:19,400 --> 00:11:20,320
MISTREATING HIS EX, CAUSING HER
TO COMMIT SUICIDE, ACCUSED PARTY: LUKE

149
00:11:22,120 --> 00:11:23,480
These are obviously photoshopped.

150
00:11:28,440 --> 00:11:29,560
I don't have this weird habit.

151
00:11:31,040 --> 00:11:32,960
Moreover, my body is in better shape.

152
00:11:33,040 --> 00:11:36,360
Mr. Luan, can't you see the objective

153
00:11:36,440 --> 00:11:40,760
of slandering you using your private life
at a time like this?

154
00:11:42,800 --> 00:11:44,920
Who received this besides you?

155
00:11:47,080 --> 00:11:49,040
I asked our colleagues at the IT division
to run a check.

156
00:11:49,120 --> 00:11:51,160
30% of our colleagues
received it, at least.

157
00:11:51,240 --> 00:11:53,000
They include all senior executives.

158
00:11:55,360 --> 00:11:57,600
Tell me. How do you plan to settle this?

159
00:12:03,600 --> 00:12:04,960
Find three of my exes

160
00:12:05,040 --> 00:12:08,040
and send them a few emails
to prove that this isn't me.

161
00:12:10,920 --> 00:12:12,280
If you don't settle this properly,

162
00:12:12,360 --> 00:12:14,800
I'll have no choice but to get help
from the internal audit and legal teams.

163
00:12:18,280 --> 00:12:19,120
I agree.

164
00:12:19,840 --> 00:12:21,920
Draft an email as soon as possible
and send it to the board.

165
00:12:22,000 --> 00:12:23,880
Request the group
to send down an investigation unit

166
00:12:24,480 --> 00:12:25,440
to investigate this immediately.

167
00:12:25,520 --> 00:12:27,800
If my reputation is damaged,

168
00:12:28,560 --> 00:12:30,040
the company will sue if need be.

169
00:12:31,680 --> 00:12:34,960
Even if you are innocent,
the employee satisfaction survey

170
00:12:35,040 --> 00:12:37,000
is also an important part
before your appointment.

171
00:12:37,600 --> 00:12:40,880
I hope you prioritize this aspect as well.

172
00:12:42,080 --> 00:12:43,720
What must come will come.

173
00:12:43,800 --> 00:12:46,640
Instead of waiting passively,
why not make the first move?

174
00:12:51,160 --> 00:12:52,240
Did you send the email?

175
00:12:52,320 --> 00:12:54,560
It was not me. I didn't send it.

176
00:12:55,080 --> 00:12:56,040
Not you?

177
00:12:56,120 --> 00:12:57,840
Are you that naive?

178
00:12:58,440 --> 00:12:59,680
Who do you think Luan Nian is?

179
00:12:59,760 --> 00:13:02,520
Do you think some tasteless scandals
can bring him down?

180
00:13:04,040 --> 00:13:05,920
Mr. Lin will soon be transferred
to the US headquarters.

181
00:13:07,560 --> 00:13:09,880
- Do you know that?
- Do I know that?

182
00:13:10,920 --> 00:13:12,880
Last week, at the executives' meeting,

183
00:13:12,960 --> 00:13:15,960
Mr. Lin already submitted
his handover plan,

184
00:13:16,040 --> 00:13:17,760
yet you're still asking me if I know that?

185
00:13:17,840 --> 00:13:19,560
I'm asking you about that email
about Luan Nian.

186
00:13:19,640 --> 00:13:21,920
- Are you a fool?
- Are you a fool?

187
00:13:23,200 --> 00:13:24,880
Once Mr. Lin leaves,
who will take over his position?

188
00:13:26,240 --> 00:13:29,760
Why do you think Luan Nian
spent so much effort

189
00:13:29,840 --> 00:13:30,680
doing the suppliers' database?

190
00:13:30,760 --> 00:13:34,200
He's showing the higher-ups
that he can manage systematically.

191
00:13:34,280 --> 00:13:35,160
So?

192
00:13:35,800 --> 00:13:37,080
When you pull such a big stunt,

193
00:13:37,160 --> 00:13:39,160
they'll still trace it back to me
in the end.

194
00:13:39,240 --> 00:13:41,080
How can I compete for Mr. Lin's position?

195
00:13:43,240 --> 00:13:46,160
It's like putting a knife to my throat
by giving him the perfect weapon.

196
00:13:46,240 --> 00:13:49,840
Du Anni, are you mad,
or do you think I no longer want this?

197
00:13:52,280 --> 00:13:54,480
Fine. Don't worry.

198
00:13:55,200 --> 00:13:59,480
If something happens,
I'll make sure you won't be implicated.

199
00:14:12,040 --> 00:14:14,040
- No way.
- Seriously?

200
00:14:15,400 --> 00:14:16,840
That is crazy.

201
00:14:16,920 --> 00:14:18,080
- Yes.
- There are pictures too.

202
00:14:18,160 --> 00:14:19,440
- It can't be fake.
- Flora.

203
00:14:19,520 --> 00:14:20,360
Flora.

204
00:14:21,760 --> 00:14:22,840
Did you receive the email?

205
00:14:23,640 --> 00:14:24,560
You didn't?

206
00:14:25,680 --> 00:14:27,240
Quick. Come here, quickly.

207
00:14:34,880 --> 00:14:36,040
LIME'S SENIOR EXECUTIVE
FOOLS AROUND WITH MULTIPLE WOMEN

208
00:14:36,120 --> 00:14:37,600
I'M ZHANG XIN, EX-GIRLFRIEND OF LUAN NIAN
LIME'S DIRECTOR IN CHINA

209
00:14:42,880 --> 00:14:43,920
I'm going back first.

210
00:15:06,240 --> 00:15:07,680
Lumi.

211
00:15:07,760 --> 00:15:09,200
I've been looking all over for you.

212
00:15:09,280 --> 00:15:10,560
I just came out for some fresh air.

213
00:15:14,280 --> 00:15:15,400
Even you know about it?

214
00:15:18,040 --> 00:15:18,880
Don't believe in it.

215
00:15:18,960 --> 00:15:20,680
This woman used to harass me too.

216
00:15:21,680 --> 00:15:24,280
She called me from overseas
and investigated my background thoroughly.

217
00:15:24,360 --> 00:15:26,320
She even knows
where my parents are staying.

218
00:15:26,400 --> 00:15:28,680
She also harassed other colleagues
and clients.

219
00:15:28,760 --> 00:15:30,000
She's just crazy.

220
00:15:30,080 --> 00:15:31,840
She also sent videos. Seriously.

221
00:15:31,920 --> 00:15:34,200
Is Luke a fool or what?

222
00:15:34,280 --> 00:15:36,320
Why did he date a woman like this?

223
00:15:37,480 --> 00:15:40,200
Do you have the video? Show me.

224
00:15:46,480 --> 00:15:48,840
I know Luan Nian isn't the violent sort.

225
00:15:48,920 --> 00:15:49,760
But…

226
00:15:50,560 --> 00:15:52,320
His name will never be cleared.

227
00:15:58,600 --> 00:15:59,880
Actually, I was there that day.

228
00:16:01,000 --> 00:16:03,200
You were there? Why?

229
00:16:03,280 --> 00:16:07,040
I wanted to buy Luke a meal to thank him,
so I went there.

230
00:16:07,800 --> 00:16:09,720
Tell me what happened that day.

231
00:16:10,480 --> 00:16:11,600
It's a long story.

232
00:16:11,680 --> 00:16:12,760
Don't tell me.

233
00:16:12,840 --> 00:16:14,520
Tell the investigation unit directly.

234
00:16:15,280 --> 00:16:16,560
I'll go with you.

235
00:16:16,640 --> 00:16:18,600
When this woman harassed me,
I had a grudge with her.

236
00:16:18,680 --> 00:16:22,280
So, I kept a record of her spam calls
and emails.

237
00:16:22,360 --> 00:16:24,240
Let's go and become
Luke's witnesses together.

238
00:16:34,800 --> 00:16:36,200
They are from the headquarters.

239
00:16:36,280 --> 00:16:37,560
They are probably here
because of this incident.

240
00:16:38,240 --> 00:16:39,280
Tracy.

241
00:16:40,440 --> 00:16:41,960
Lisa. Take them to the meeting room first.

242
00:16:42,040 --> 00:16:43,680
- All right.
- This way, please.

243
00:16:44,600 --> 00:16:45,800
Why are you two here?

244
00:16:45,880 --> 00:16:47,000
We want to become Luke's witnesses.

245
00:16:47,080 --> 00:16:49,040
- What witness?
- The email.

246
00:16:49,800 --> 00:16:52,000
Regarding this,
Luke specifically mentioned

247
00:16:52,080 --> 00:16:53,920
that he didn't want anyone else
to get involved.

248
00:16:54,000 --> 00:16:58,040
Tracy, is this serious?

249
00:16:58,800 --> 00:16:59,640
Don't worry.

250
00:16:59,720 --> 00:17:00,920
The company will deal with it properly.

251
00:17:01,520 --> 00:17:02,760
Go back and wait for updates.

252
00:17:02,840 --> 00:17:03,680
Remember.

253
00:17:03,760 --> 00:17:04,920
Don't ever get yourself involved in this.

254
00:17:06,160 --> 00:17:07,000
I'm going to work.

255
00:17:18,520 --> 00:17:20,560
Perhaps Luke does have a plan.

256
00:17:22,720 --> 00:17:24,480
Let's wait and see.

257
00:17:24,560 --> 00:17:28,520
If we can't attest for him,
we can still think of some other ways.

258
00:17:31,560 --> 00:17:33,760
What kind of person
do you think Luan Nian is?

259
00:17:36,240 --> 00:17:37,280
He's strict.

260
00:17:37,360 --> 00:17:41,520
He's a little heartless,
but he is indeed talented.

261
00:17:41,600 --> 00:17:43,520
Strict. Professional. Serious.

262
00:17:43,600 --> 00:17:45,120
A very good leader.

263
00:17:45,680 --> 00:17:46,520
His flaws…

264
00:17:47,640 --> 00:17:49,040
He gets too much attention from women.

265
00:17:49,120 --> 00:17:53,400
Have you seen him
acting overly intimate with others?

266
00:17:53,480 --> 00:17:55,920
I don't think so.

267
00:17:56,000 --> 00:17:57,000
I'm not sure.

268
00:17:57,600 --> 00:17:58,520
Never.

269
00:17:58,600 --> 00:18:02,280
Do you know anything
about Luan Nian's ex-girlfriend?

270
00:18:03,360 --> 00:18:05,200
How would I know about his private life?

271
00:18:05,280 --> 00:18:06,360
No.

272
00:18:06,440 --> 00:18:08,800
Do you think Luan Nian
has a violent tendency?

273
00:18:08,880 --> 00:18:10,600
- No.
- Of course not.

274
00:18:11,960 --> 00:18:13,960
Do the silent treatment
and being controlling count?

275
00:18:18,240 --> 00:18:19,120
I'm not sure.

276
00:18:29,560 --> 00:18:32,360
Let's skip the pleasantries
and go straight to the point.

277
00:18:33,000 --> 00:18:35,000
Tracy mentioned you would like
to clear something up.

278
00:18:38,400 --> 00:18:39,280
It isn't a clarification per se.

279
00:18:43,600 --> 00:18:45,080
Everyone, you can look at this.

280
00:18:45,160 --> 00:18:46,920
This isn't just an email sent to everyone.

281
00:18:47,000 --> 00:18:47,840
SENDING METHOD: BCC

282
00:18:47,920 --> 00:18:52,320
The sender used the BCC function
and added every receiver manually.

283
00:18:52,400 --> 00:18:53,720
What does this mean?

284
00:18:53,800 --> 00:18:55,720
It means two things. One.

285
00:18:55,800 --> 00:18:58,280
The sender knows the internal
staff organization of Lime clearly.

286
00:18:58,360 --> 00:19:00,280
That is why the person
can choose the recipients precisely.

287
00:19:01,000 --> 00:19:03,760
Two. She deliberately avoided using BCC

288
00:19:03,840 --> 00:19:06,080
and hid the list of all recipients

289
00:19:06,160 --> 00:19:08,400
to prevent me from finding
the source of the leak.

290
00:19:09,760 --> 00:19:14,120
But it is also possible that you leaked
this information to your ex-girlfriend.

291
00:19:16,240 --> 00:19:17,120
You are right.

292
00:19:18,520 --> 00:19:21,080
However, among the recipients
of this email,

293
00:19:21,160 --> 00:19:24,680
there are 11 new employees
who joined less than a year ago.

294
00:19:24,760 --> 00:19:27,280
I broke up with my ex-girlfriend
more than a year ago.

295
00:19:27,360 --> 00:19:30,280
She would never get the email addresses
of these new employees.

296
00:19:45,080 --> 00:19:47,600
Is your dad crazy?

297
00:19:47,680 --> 00:19:50,040
We already opened for business, and now
he wants to take back the property.

298
00:19:50,120 --> 00:19:51,920
My dad doesn't allow me to run a bar.

299
00:19:52,000 --> 00:19:53,080
Why didn't he say this earlier?

300
00:19:53,160 --> 00:19:56,240
If the bar closes down,
all the money we invested will be gone.

301
00:19:56,320 --> 00:19:58,680
My savings don't fall from the sky.

302
00:19:58,760 --> 00:19:59,680
Will your dad compensate me?

303
00:20:00,280 --> 00:20:01,840
Why don't you go talk to my father?

304
00:20:01,920 --> 00:20:03,480
Hey, that's your dad.

305
00:20:03,560 --> 00:20:06,560
I… I can't believe dictatorship
still exists at this time and age.

306
00:20:10,680 --> 00:20:13,040
Luan Nian, isn't your father
and his father best buddies?

307
00:20:13,120 --> 00:20:14,320
Go and talk to him.

308
00:20:15,760 --> 00:20:18,920
Can you two think before you speak?

309
00:20:19,000 --> 00:20:20,800
Asking Luan Nian to talk to his father?

310
00:20:20,880 --> 00:20:22,320
Your bar will close down even sooner.

311
00:20:22,400 --> 00:20:23,920
Exactly. What a terrible idea.

312
00:20:24,000 --> 00:20:26,280
His father and my father
are always on the same page.

313
00:20:26,360 --> 00:20:27,520
Exactly.

314
00:20:27,600 --> 00:20:28,920
Enough. Let's not talk about this.

315
00:20:29,800 --> 00:20:31,680
I'm looking for all of you today
because I need a favor.

316
00:20:31,760 --> 00:20:33,640
- What's wrong?
- You didn't invest a single cent.

317
00:20:33,720 --> 00:20:35,080
Of course, you don't care.

318
00:20:35,160 --> 00:20:37,640
I can cover the equipment
and renovation fees of the bar.

319
00:20:37,720 --> 00:20:40,120
Find a quiet place
to reopen the bar later.

320
00:20:40,200 --> 00:20:42,160
Here's your sponsor daddy.

321
00:20:42,240 --> 00:20:43,440
- Oh my!
- Daddy.

322
00:20:44,040 --> 00:20:46,160
- Get lost.
- You're so generous, Daddy.

323
00:20:46,960 --> 00:20:48,040
Hurry up.

324
00:20:48,760 --> 00:20:50,280
It's your turn to help me out now.

325
00:20:50,360 --> 00:20:52,200
- Go to a place with me later.
- Sure.

326
00:20:52,280 --> 00:20:54,680
- We'll do anything for you.
- No problem.

327
00:21:08,680 --> 00:21:09,600
Over there.

328
00:21:09,680 --> 00:21:11,320
The electrical box is over there.

329
00:21:11,400 --> 00:21:13,080
I thought the circuit breaker
had tripped back then.

330
00:21:13,160 --> 00:21:16,200
After I investigated, the wires
were obviously cut by someone else.

331
00:21:16,920 --> 00:21:19,040
I thought it was done by some naughty kid
from the neighborhood.

332
00:21:19,720 --> 00:21:20,800
When the power went out,

333
00:21:21,440 --> 00:21:23,240
my shop's CCTV stopped recording.

334
00:21:23,320 --> 00:21:25,480
Moreover, I watched the video.

335
00:21:25,560 --> 00:21:29,440
I'm sure she already set up
the camera behind this wall

336
00:21:29,520 --> 00:21:31,000
and edited the captured footage.

337
00:21:31,680 --> 00:21:33,160
Looking at the video's angle,

338
00:21:33,240 --> 00:21:35,560
I'm sure she was recording from there.

339
00:21:35,640 --> 00:21:36,840
Yes.

340
00:21:38,800 --> 00:21:41,040
You two have only been together
for a few days,

341
00:21:41,600 --> 00:21:42,800
and she's already working
with outsiders to set you up.

342
00:21:44,000 --> 00:21:45,520
Do you still not get it?

343
00:21:45,600 --> 00:21:47,040
She was used.

344
00:21:47,120 --> 00:21:50,120
Otherwise, she wouldn't have found
a hidden place like mine.

345
00:21:50,720 --> 00:21:52,680
What is this important deal you're in?

346
00:21:52,760 --> 00:21:56,520
Your enemy had to go out of their way
to film the whole thing.

347
00:21:57,040 --> 00:22:00,640
The only benefit of this job
is that I get to stay away from my father.

348
00:22:01,160 --> 00:22:02,320
We don't have to investigate it.

349
00:22:03,440 --> 00:22:04,280
No.

350
00:22:04,840 --> 00:22:06,560
We must find this jerk.

351
00:22:06,640 --> 00:22:09,000
Even if you're quitting,
you still can't take this lying down.

352
00:22:09,080 --> 00:22:10,320
That's right.

353
00:22:13,680 --> 00:22:16,920
Tan, whose car is this?

354
00:22:17,000 --> 00:22:18,000
What car?

355
00:22:18,920 --> 00:22:20,600
It's for delivering goods
for the shop. Why?

356
00:22:20,680 --> 00:22:21,920
This car has a dashcam.

357
00:22:22,560 --> 00:22:23,880
It has always been recording.

358
00:22:24,400 --> 00:22:26,000
It must have recorded the whole thing.

359
00:22:26,080 --> 00:22:27,800
- You're really lucky.
- Come on. Let's go back to the hotel.

360
00:22:27,880 --> 00:22:29,360
- Let's go.
- Let's go.

361
00:22:47,080 --> 00:22:49,800
LUAN NIAN'S SUSPENSION NOTICE

362
00:22:51,160 --> 00:22:53,400
<i>After internal discussion,</i>
<i>the general manager's office</i>

363
00:22:53,480 --> 00:22:55,080
<i>at headquarters has decided</i>

364
00:22:55,160 --> 00:22:58,040
<i>that all of Luke Luan's duties</i>
<i>will be suspended from today onward</i>

365
00:22:58,120 --> 00:22:59,880
<i>until the investigation result</i>
<i>is released.</i>

366
00:22:59,960 --> 00:23:01,000
<i>During the suspension,</i>

367
00:23:01,080 --> 00:23:04,400
<i>all of Luke Luan's duties</i>
<i>will be temporarily handled by Alex Zhang.</i>

368
00:23:29,800 --> 00:23:31,880
<i>What kind of person</i>
<i>do you think Luan Nian is?</i>

369
00:23:32,480 --> 00:23:34,480
He is a very good leader.

370
00:23:34,560 --> 00:23:37,360
Although he looks aloof and cold
and unapproachable on the outside,

371
00:23:37,440 --> 00:23:40,440
I find him to be patient
after getting to know him.

372
00:23:41,040 --> 00:23:42,440
<i>Moreover, he keeps personal issues</i>
<i>separate from work.</i>

373
00:23:44,200 --> 00:23:45,560
<i>When he is socializing outside,</i>

374
00:23:45,640 --> 00:23:47,840
<i>he'll make sure</i>
<i>his female colleagues feel safe.</i>

375
00:23:47,920 --> 00:23:49,280
<i>He is willing to share his knowledge</i>

376
00:23:49,360 --> 00:23:50,680
<i>even with those</i>
<i>who are not his subordinates.</i>

377
00:23:51,360 --> 00:23:53,800
<i>Many people in the company, including me,</i>

378
00:23:53,880 --> 00:23:55,440
<i>have received his guidance.</i>

379
00:24:07,640 --> 00:24:08,720
Hello.

380
00:24:08,800 --> 00:24:09,800
Visitor needs to register…

381
00:24:11,320 --> 00:24:13,200
Hello. Welcome home.

382
00:24:38,800 --> 00:24:41,200
‪REMOTE, 10:37 PM

383
00:25:40,600 --> 00:25:42,080
It's the middle of the night.

384
00:25:42,160 --> 00:25:43,440
The neighbors will complain

385
00:25:43,960 --> 00:25:45,160
if you keep pressing
the doorbell like crazy.

386
00:25:49,280 --> 00:25:51,520
Don't you know the passcode for my door?

387
00:25:54,960 --> 00:25:55,800
Come in.

388
00:26:06,760 --> 00:26:08,000
You didn't change the passcode?

389
00:26:08,800 --> 00:26:10,000
Why should I?

390
00:26:14,480 --> 00:26:15,400
Are you all right?

391
00:26:16,480 --> 00:26:17,320
Not really.

392
00:26:18,240 --> 00:26:19,120
My face is ruined.

393
00:26:20,960 --> 00:26:21,920
I'm too embarrassed to see anyone.

394
00:26:23,560 --> 00:26:24,480
Did you…

395
00:26:24,560 --> 00:26:26,680
Did you fight with the people
of the investigation unit?

396
00:26:28,680 --> 00:26:30,520
You are really imaginative.

397
00:26:31,320 --> 00:26:32,200
I got nicked by a razor.

398
00:26:33,400 --> 00:26:35,160
All because you keep pressing
the doorbell.

399
00:26:36,280 --> 00:26:37,240
Do you have a band-aid?

400
00:26:37,320 --> 00:26:38,320
Let me put it on for you.

401
00:26:39,560 --> 00:26:41,000
It's in the coffee table's drawer.

402
00:27:17,440 --> 00:27:18,280
Forget it.

403
00:27:19,600 --> 00:27:20,440
It's nothing serious.

404
00:27:24,920 --> 00:27:27,280
Did the investigation unit
talk to you today?

405
00:27:29,560 --> 00:27:33,080
I came here to tell you
that I can be your witness

406
00:27:34,320 --> 00:27:35,480
if you want.

407
00:27:40,760 --> 00:27:43,720
Aren't you trying
to keep a distance from me?

408
00:27:48,280 --> 00:27:50,560
I know you don't want others
to get involved,

409
00:27:51,280 --> 00:27:52,760
but now is not the time for that.

410
00:27:54,640 --> 00:27:55,640
What do you mean?

411
00:27:55,720 --> 00:27:57,760
You've been suspended.

412
00:27:59,640 --> 00:28:00,840
Have you seen those pictures?

413
00:28:04,120 --> 00:28:05,520
You can look at them.

414
00:28:07,400 --> 00:28:08,480
Other people might not see the difference,

415
00:28:09,360 --> 00:28:11,080
but you should know
that the person isn't me.

416
00:28:17,200 --> 00:28:18,120
Come with me.

417
00:28:18,200 --> 00:28:19,160
Let me take you somewhere.

418
00:28:29,560 --> 00:28:30,720
Where is this?

419
00:28:32,760 --> 00:28:34,440
I want to open a bar in the mountains.

420
00:28:36,800 --> 00:28:38,160
What do you think of this place?

421
00:28:40,240 --> 00:28:41,640
Here?

422
00:28:43,760 --> 00:28:44,840
In the mountains.

423
00:28:45,840 --> 00:28:47,520
Something like a private bar.

424
00:28:47,600 --> 00:28:49,280
It'll only be open to a handful of people.

425
00:28:49,920 --> 00:28:51,000
Do you think it'll work?

426
00:28:56,960 --> 00:28:58,120
This place

427
00:29:00,200 --> 00:29:01,840
is good for stargazing.

428
00:29:06,600 --> 00:29:08,760
All right. This is the place, then.

429
00:29:10,120 --> 00:29:11,120
You're making a decision so casually?

430
00:29:11,200 --> 00:29:15,080
Then, I think this place
could use a little makeover.

431
00:29:17,560 --> 00:29:18,560
I'll take your advice.

432
00:29:25,240 --> 00:29:27,120
This place is indeed good for stargazing.

433
00:29:35,040 --> 00:29:37,760
Are you really leaving Lime?

434
00:29:39,360 --> 00:29:42,400
Is this incident that serious?

435
00:29:45,280 --> 00:29:46,920
I don't lose anything if Lime fires me.

436
00:29:47,000 --> 00:29:48,480
Lime will lose a lot, in fact.

437
00:29:51,440 --> 00:29:53,200
You must never leave Lime.

438
00:29:54,040 --> 00:29:55,080
Don't give up.

439
00:29:57,040 --> 00:30:00,280
Because I think you are a great teacher.

440
00:30:00,880 --> 00:30:02,400
I can learn a lot

441
00:30:04,000 --> 00:30:05,560
from you.

442
00:30:08,440 --> 00:30:09,360
Shang Zhitao.

443
00:30:11,160 --> 00:30:12,640
Isn't your desire for knowledge

444
00:30:13,720 --> 00:30:15,080
too strong?

445
00:30:17,280 --> 00:30:18,120
I…

446
00:30:18,960 --> 00:30:22,040
I don't want to lose the opportunity
to learn from you.

447
00:30:22,120 --> 00:30:24,360
Besides, I don't want
to be eliminated from Lime

448
00:30:24,880 --> 00:30:25,920
because of my incompetence.

449
00:30:29,720 --> 00:30:31,880
You might be harsh when you're teaching,

450
00:30:31,960 --> 00:30:32,920
but

451
00:30:33,840 --> 00:30:35,720
everything you've said has been useful.

452
00:30:48,320 --> 00:30:49,840
If I promise you that I won't leave,

453
00:30:51,840 --> 00:30:53,680
can you not keep your distance
from me tonight?

454
00:31:03,440 --> 00:31:04,280
Why are you staring at me?

455
00:31:05,200 --> 00:31:06,840
Am I more interesting than the stars?

456
00:32:40,040 --> 00:32:41,200
<i>The person who falls</i>
<i>for the other person first</i>

457
00:32:41,800 --> 00:32:44,200
<i>will lower all their guard</i>
<i>and lose everything.</i>

458
00:32:47,480 --> 00:32:48,360
<i>I know this.</i>

459
00:32:51,440 --> 00:32:54,800
<i>But I'm just worried</i>
<i>that this wonderful moment</i>

460
00:32:55,560 --> 00:32:57,200
<i>is a result of my recklessness.</i>

461
00:33:09,280 --> 00:33:11,240
It's too late tonight.

462
00:33:11,760 --> 00:33:13,400
I still have to go to work tomorrow.

463
00:33:17,680 --> 00:33:18,800
Let's go back first.

464
00:33:19,600 --> 00:33:20,480
Sure.

465
00:33:45,400 --> 00:33:48,000
Boss. The image verification result,

466
00:33:48,600 --> 00:33:49,880
the footage that shows the truth,

467
00:33:49,960 --> 00:33:51,800
and information about
all related people are inside.

468
00:33:53,000 --> 00:33:55,200
Do you want to submit it
to the investigation unit

469
00:33:55,280 --> 00:33:56,280
or…

470
00:34:03,720 --> 00:34:04,560
Why didn't you

471
00:34:05,440 --> 00:34:07,680
submit this to the investigation
unit yourself?

472
00:34:08,760 --> 00:34:09,639
No need.

473
00:34:12,760 --> 00:34:16,040
But Alex said he didn't do any of these.

474
00:34:16,120 --> 00:34:19,040
Even if he didn't, he is still implicated.

475
00:34:20,040 --> 00:34:22,360
If you still want
to progress further in your career,

476
00:34:23,520 --> 00:34:26,719
making fewer enemies isn't a bad thing.

477
00:34:29,239 --> 00:34:30,400
Yes.

478
00:34:30,480 --> 00:34:32,880
If this breach of confidence
becomes public,

479
00:34:32,960 --> 00:34:36,120
the consequences will be far more dire
than my scandals.

480
00:34:36,199 --> 00:34:38,520
It is no longer an issue
of an employee's character,

481
00:34:38,600 --> 00:34:41,840
but a breach of confidence
caused by internal in-fighting.

482
00:34:42,679 --> 00:34:45,040
When that happens,
the headquarters will punish us,

483
00:34:45,120 --> 00:34:47,320
and all our peers
in the advertising industry

484
00:34:47,400 --> 00:34:48,360
will see us as a laughingstock.

485
00:34:49,400 --> 00:34:51,679
Clients will even switch
to other companies

486
00:34:51,760 --> 00:34:53,120
because of this.

487
00:34:53,199 --> 00:34:54,480
It's just not worth it.

488
00:35:02,720 --> 00:35:04,800
Once this incident is over,

489
00:35:04,880 --> 00:35:07,040
the position of interim general manager
is yours.

490
00:35:08,360 --> 00:35:09,280
It is

491
00:35:10,920 --> 00:35:12,160
supposed to be yours anyway.

492
00:35:13,880 --> 00:35:14,720
Of course.

493
00:35:26,480 --> 00:35:28,640
"Following a thorough investigation
by the joint investigation team,

494
00:35:28,720 --> 00:35:30,200
it is proven that the allegations against

495
00:35:30,280 --> 00:35:32,320
Lime Advertising China's
Creative Director, Luke Luan,

496
00:35:32,400 --> 00:35:35,760
are false and defamatory."

497
00:35:36,280 --> 00:35:39,840
"Relevant details will not be disclosed
to respect the wishes of the parties.

498
00:35:39,920 --> 00:35:42,440
Moving forward,
Lime China's Legal Department

499
00:35:42,520 --> 00:35:45,240
will assist Luan Nian
in taking legal action against Zhang Xin.

500
00:35:45,320 --> 00:35:46,600
Notice is hereby given."

501
00:35:48,920 --> 00:35:50,320
"After a unanimous decision,

502
00:35:50,400 --> 00:35:52,400
Luan Nian will now be appointed

503
00:35:52,480 --> 00:35:55,080
as Lime Advertising China's
Interim General Manager."

504
00:35:57,520 --> 00:35:58,440
APPOINTMENT NOTICE

505
00:36:06,360 --> 00:36:07,280
Hello, Mr. Luan.

506
00:36:24,120 --> 00:36:25,320
Hello, Mr. Luan.

507
00:36:25,400 --> 00:36:26,320
Hello, Mr. Luan.

508
00:36:27,720 --> 00:36:30,840
Inform every division
to have a budget meeting in one hour.

509
00:36:30,920 --> 00:36:32,000
Yes.

510
00:36:33,720 --> 00:36:35,480
The empress has returned.

511
00:36:37,680 --> 00:36:39,880
Excuse me. Please wait
for a while, everyone.

512
00:36:46,880 --> 00:36:48,440
I have so much work to do
as soon as I come back?

513
00:36:49,440 --> 00:36:52,360
These documents require the signature
of a general manager.

514
00:36:52,440 --> 00:36:54,080
Go ahead, Mr. Luan.

515
00:36:55,040 --> 00:36:57,400
I've submitted Flora's promotion to SAE.

516
00:36:57,480 --> 00:36:58,800
Please approve it.

517
00:37:01,440 --> 00:37:03,560
When do you plan to move your office?

518
00:37:03,640 --> 00:37:05,880
Mr. Lin's office has been cleared.

519
00:37:11,520 --> 00:37:12,720
I won't be moving.

520
00:37:12,800 --> 00:37:13,920
This floor is nice.

521
00:37:14,000 --> 00:37:15,320
It's convenient for meetings.

522
00:37:15,400 --> 00:37:17,120
No problem. It's your decision.

523
00:37:18,080 --> 00:37:19,040
You just got appointed.

524
00:37:19,120 --> 00:37:21,800
The most important task
is to restructure our sales team.

525
00:37:21,880 --> 00:37:23,560
They are big shots in the industry.

526
00:37:23,640 --> 00:37:24,800
It's not easy to manage them.

527
00:37:24,880 --> 00:37:25,760
I've been thinking about a reformation.

528
00:37:26,600 --> 00:37:28,320
I'll keep you in the loop
once I come out with the proposal.

529
00:37:29,520 --> 00:37:32,920
Okay. But the elimination rate of the team
should still be kept at 30%.

530
00:37:33,000 --> 00:37:35,800
Otherwise, when the time comes
to evaluate you,

531
00:37:35,880 --> 00:37:36,840
don't blame me
for giving you a bad rating.

532
00:37:39,120 --> 00:37:40,120
Come in.

533
00:37:42,760 --> 00:37:46,280
Luke. Today we need to align the budget
for the project proposal meeting.

534
00:37:46,360 --> 00:37:48,120
I've sent all the details to your email.

535
00:37:48,200 --> 00:37:49,040
Okay.

536
00:37:49,920 --> 00:37:51,160
Who will be present in the meeting?

537
00:37:51,840 --> 00:37:55,000
Since you're newly appointed,
let's visit every division.

538
00:37:55,080 --> 00:37:56,280
Let's go.

539
00:37:58,480 --> 00:37:59,400
Next group.

540
00:38:05,600 --> 00:38:08,480
Let's first talk about the industry
seminar your division is in charge of.

541
00:38:09,840 --> 00:38:12,480
This year, we've decided on cities like
Beijing, Shanghai, Guangzhou, Shenzhen,

542
00:38:12,560 --> 00:38:14,840
Hong Kong, China, Chongqing, and Xiamen.

543
00:38:14,920 --> 00:38:17,320
We also want to invite clients
from various industries

544
00:38:17,400 --> 00:38:18,840
for a joint seminar.

545
00:38:18,920 --> 00:38:20,440
The objective
is client relationship management.

546
00:38:20,520 --> 00:38:24,200
This is also
Lime's most valued annual tradition.

547
00:38:25,560 --> 00:38:27,520
If it's just to maintain
a relationship with clients,

548
00:38:27,600 --> 00:38:29,800
taking them out for a meal and drinks
would be good enough.

549
00:38:30,400 --> 00:38:31,480
A 500,000-yuan budget is good enough.

550
00:38:32,240 --> 00:38:34,000
Why should I spend 17 million yuan

551
00:38:34,080 --> 00:38:36,800
to achieve something
that can be done with 500,000 yuan?

552
00:38:41,480 --> 00:38:42,640
How do you plan to adjust it?

553
00:38:43,640 --> 00:38:45,480
Unless you have a concrete idea,

554
00:38:45,560 --> 00:38:48,040
my suggestion is to remove it completely.

555
00:38:56,440 --> 00:38:58,520
Mr. Luan, what about this?

556
00:38:58,600 --> 00:39:01,800
I'll go back and study more
about this project with my team.

557
00:39:01,880 --> 00:39:05,760
Actually, managing client relationships
is just a small part of this project.

558
00:39:05,840 --> 00:39:09,080
Making an impact in the industry
is also very important.

559
00:39:10,080 --> 00:39:11,680
Besides the list of clients,

560
00:39:11,760 --> 00:39:12,800
what kind of experts can you invite,

561
00:39:12,880 --> 00:39:14,280
and how many potential clients
can you bring?

562
00:39:16,320 --> 00:39:18,040
Study it carefully
before we decide if we want it.

563
00:39:22,440 --> 00:39:24,120
Alex, is that okay with you?

564
00:39:27,920 --> 00:39:28,960
Of course.

565
00:39:32,560 --> 00:39:33,600
What about you, Annie?

566
00:39:35,800 --> 00:39:37,640
Whatever you say.

567
00:39:39,240 --> 00:39:40,080
All right.

568
00:39:40,680 --> 00:39:43,280
I'll have to trouble all of you
to revise everything.

569
00:39:43,360 --> 00:39:45,720
Every budget
will be discussed again tomorrow.

570
00:39:45,800 --> 00:39:47,360
My request is simple.

571
00:39:47,440 --> 00:39:51,040
Think it through
before you decide on doing something.

572
00:39:51,120 --> 00:39:53,280
Once everyone agrees on the core progress,

573
00:39:53,360 --> 00:39:54,600
make sure to report back.

574
00:39:55,760 --> 00:39:58,920
There must be a solution
to every problem you encounter.

575
00:39:59,000 --> 00:40:00,320
Okay?

576
00:40:03,080 --> 00:40:05,200
Mr. Luan is asking
if all of you are okay with it.

577
00:40:07,480 --> 00:40:09,800
- Who is doing the meeting minutes?
- I am.

578
00:40:09,880 --> 00:40:11,480
After the meeting,

579
00:40:11,560 --> 00:40:13,400
send it to everyone
who is in this meeting and CC me.

580
00:40:13,480 --> 00:40:14,320
Okay.

581
00:40:18,600 --> 00:40:20,880
He sure makes full use
of his first day of work.

582
00:40:20,960 --> 00:40:23,320
Be careful. Mind your attitude.

583
00:40:23,400 --> 00:40:25,200
We are talking about more than
10 million yuan. How should I react?

584
00:40:26,200 --> 00:40:27,760
Everyone, gather around.

585
00:40:33,160 --> 00:40:34,400
I have an announcement to make.

586
00:40:34,480 --> 00:40:36,960
There'll be a friendly
basketball match with Yueteng.

587
00:40:37,040 --> 00:40:39,480
It won't be considered as your KPI
or your job.

588
00:40:39,560 --> 00:40:40,600
Which division can handle it?

589
00:40:40,680 --> 00:40:42,360
Who wants to take charge?

590
00:40:49,240 --> 00:40:50,600
I can do it.

591
00:40:55,080 --> 00:40:56,280
Okay.

592
00:40:56,360 --> 00:40:58,360
I'll leave it to you. Thank you.

593
00:41:23,760 --> 00:41:24,600
Feeling vindicated?

594
00:41:26,080 --> 00:41:26,920
Do you feel vindicated?

595
00:41:28,400 --> 00:41:29,360
Yes.

596
00:41:30,120 --> 00:41:32,880
Actually, I received
Luke's email last night.

597
00:41:33,600 --> 00:41:36,160
He told me he would initiate
the project budget meeting

598
00:41:36,240 --> 00:41:37,560
and the project evaluation today.

599
00:41:37,640 --> 00:41:39,280
I got it immediately.

600
00:41:39,920 --> 00:41:42,280
I was sure that he solved everything.

601
00:41:43,280 --> 00:41:44,400
But this morning,

602
00:41:45,000 --> 00:41:48,600
I still felt excited
when I received this email.

603
00:41:48,680 --> 00:41:49,720
It felt so good.

604
00:41:52,320 --> 00:41:54,720
Lumi, what project evaluation?

605
00:41:54,800 --> 00:41:56,800
Can I join?

606
00:41:56,880 --> 00:41:59,480
Because I want to become
an independent project manager.

607
00:41:59,560 --> 00:42:01,040
Doing this helps gather experience.

608
00:42:01,120 --> 00:42:02,760
No, Shang Zhitao.

609
00:42:02,840 --> 00:42:05,120
Are you even normal?

610
00:42:05,200 --> 00:42:07,360
Why do you like to work so much?

611
00:42:09,240 --> 00:42:12,120
If you want to do it,
go and ask the boss directly.

612
00:42:12,720 --> 00:42:15,280
He is now the general manager.

613
00:42:15,360 --> 00:42:16,760
General manager.

614
00:42:17,840 --> 00:42:18,800
Go for it.

615
00:42:21,320 --> 00:42:22,400
Lumi.

616
00:42:23,640 --> 00:42:27,040
You are so capable,
and you can do everything well.

617
00:42:27,120 --> 00:42:31,240
Why don't you request
to handle a project all by yourself?

618
00:42:32,080 --> 00:42:33,760
Handling a project all by myself?

619
00:42:33,840 --> 00:42:36,480
Forget it. I'm already tired enough.

620
00:42:37,760 --> 00:42:41,040
I'm working because I just
want something to do.

621
00:42:42,000 --> 00:42:43,360
I have Luke to cover me.

622
00:42:43,440 --> 00:42:46,120
I'm grateful to the competitive Luke

623
00:42:46,200 --> 00:42:48,120
for letting me achieve great things
by doing nothing.

624
00:42:52,200 --> 00:42:53,720
He is quite a hard worker.

625
00:42:53,800 --> 00:42:55,200
If he doesn't work hard,

626
00:42:55,280 --> 00:43:00,280
how can he manage such a big team
in the advertising industry?

627
00:43:03,240 --> 00:43:07,080
Everything is good about him,

628
00:43:07,680 --> 00:43:10,240
but you must never fall for him.

629
00:43:11,680 --> 00:43:13,440
Why not?

630
00:43:14,040 --> 00:43:16,680
He has a really bad temper.

631
00:43:17,960 --> 00:43:20,840
Even someone as experienced as me

632
00:43:20,920 --> 00:43:23,320
will probably be brokenhearted
and shed tears because of him.

633
00:43:25,120 --> 00:43:28,680
However, I don't mind being friends

634
00:43:29,360 --> 00:43:31,240
with someone as handsome as him.

635
00:43:32,920 --> 00:43:34,760
Tracy, you're right.

636
00:43:34,840 --> 00:43:36,800
You run your mouth like a train.

637
00:43:37,880 --> 00:43:39,520
I'm the high-speed rail.
